  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional Financing for Central Asia South Asia Electricity Transmission and Trade Project (CASA-1000) KGZ0051</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the parent project is to meet the electricity demand in Afghanistan and Pakistan through the establishment of cross-border energy exchange among four member countries as part of regional economic integration. The exchange will be utilizing efficient, and environmentally friendly indigenous hydropower resources of Kyrgyz Republic and Tajikistan. The project creates the conditions for sustainable electricity trade between the Central Asian countries of Kyrgyz Republic and Tajikistan with the South Asian countries of Afghanistan and Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
